#: docs/explanation/source-map.md:10
msgid ""
"本页定位当前实现，不复制各目录的完整合同。生产 MCU 入口只有 STM32F4，已迁入 F407VE／ZG；其他 SDK "
"原位保留。目录、实现、执行记录和物理资格分别说明。"
msgstr ""
"This page locates current implementations without duplicating each "
"directory's full contract. The sole production MCU entry point is STM32F4, "
"with F407VE/ZG migrated; other SDKs remain in place. Directories, "
"implementations, execution records and physical qualification are described "
"separately."

